  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: This set of values contains diagnoses or problems that represent that the patient has Clubfoot regardless of the clinical presentation of the clinical presentation of the condition.),(Data Element Scope: Diagnoses or problems documented in a clinical record.),(Inclusion Criteria: Talipes equinovarus (including congenital, idiopathic, and neurogenic), talipes not otherwise specified, clubfoot not otherwise specified.),(Exclusion Criteria: Talipes equinovalgus, talipes calcaneovarus, talipes calcaneovalgus, talipes varus, talipes valgus, vertical talus, metatarsus adductus alone, metatarsus varus alone, pes varus, pes valgus, pes planus, rocker-bottom foot, positional or postural clubfoot.)",
